# Hello World Example

```fluid
pragma fluid ^1.0;

contract HelloWorld fluid {
    state persistent {
        string message;
    }

    transaction setMessage(string newMessage)
    requires newMessage != ""
    {
        preflight {
            Security.require_no_reentrancy();
        }

        atomic {
            message = newMessage;
        }
    }
}
```

This is a minimal example to help a new developer understand how a contract is structured.
